#: src/Admin/HelpDocumentationPage.php:116
msgid "Open PublishRank → Features (previously called SEO Modules). Each card is one feature, such as the XML sitemap, Google News sitemap, schema, social previews, breadcrumbs, redirects or IndexNow. The switch saves instantly: switch a feature off and its output stops straight away; switch it on again and your saved settings come back. Use the Settings link on a card to fine-tune that feature. The same switches appear in a compact form on the Dashboard."
msgstr ""

